{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act16d5_level_act16d5_10_end",
  "groupId": "act16d5",
  "stageId": "act16d5_10",
  "title": "夕",
  "storyCode": "WR-10",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act16d5/level_act16d5_10_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "04106deb57d62a1f0c8e47c5a18b274bfbaa3ae4f9f90dc3d144a7ec6b0f1c61",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerId": "char_2014_nian",
      "text": "就因為你這脾氣，又不搭理人，又突然生氣，總擺著個臉色，也只有你的好姐姐我肯來照顧你了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerId": "char_2015_dusk",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerId": "char_2014_nian",
      "text": "你和那寫字的關係不好，是因為你倆都不肯承認字畫同源，和我關係不好，是因為你不肯接受微辣的火鍋——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerId": "char_2014_nian",
      "text": "欸，要是你再搬出磐蟹霜淇淋鍋這種東西，說不定我就真投降了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerId": "char_2015_dusk",
      "text": "......嘴倔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerId": "char_2015_dusk",
      "text": "不是因為你已經沒力氣了，才說這些話拖延時間的嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerId": "char_2014_nian",
      "text": "......哎呀，你這麼多年......是真的從來沒閉過眼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerId": "char_2015_dusk",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerId": "char_2014_nian",
      "text": "熬夜工作也許會比小睡一兩個小時更清醒，但累積的疲勞遲早會讓你垮掉哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerId": "char_2014_nian",
      "text": "啊，我知道了，你是在害怕。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerId": "char_2015_dusk",
      "text": "你......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerId": "char_2014_nian",
      "text": "你比誰都清楚自己是什麼，你知道自己也不過是個畫中人，你怕自己一夢醒來，就不復存在——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerId": "char_2015_dusk",
      "text": "住口！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerId": "char_2014_nian",
      "text": "欸，別這麼著急。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerId": "char_2014_nian",
      "text": "我們都得正視它，我們誰都逃離不了自我的真相。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerId": "char_2015_dusk",
      "text": "嘁。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerId": "char_2015_dusk",
      "text": "......你居然會這麼感性，是不是睡傻了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerId": "char_2014_nian",
      "text": "當“我們”甦醒，再次俯視大地的時候，現在的你我都將消失。消失得一乾二淨。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerId": "char_2014_nian",
      "text": "不僅如此，“我們”會掀起滔天的怒火。在“我們”的關係斷絕前，我始終能感覺到屈辱和憤懣......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerId": "char_2014_nian",
      "text": "而我呢，不是特別甘心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerId": "char_2015_dusk",
      "text": "......你要......反抗它？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerId": "char_2015_dusk",
      "text": "癡人說夢。身體的部分如何反抗整個軀體？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerId": "char_2014_nian",
      "text": "欸，這個例子我好像也用過。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerId": "char_2015_dusk",
      "text": "別油嘴滑舌，已經沒時間了——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerId": "char_2014_nian",
      "text": "我知道。所以不止我一個人這麼想，在“我們”——不，已經與我們斷絕了關係的瘋物已經不能稱作“我們”了——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerId": "char_2014_nian",
      "text": "——在“它”醒來之前，我們必須做好萬全的準備，無論借用什麼力量，我們都得這麼做。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerId": "char_2014_nian",
      "text": "不為了任何東西，只為了我們自己，以及我們喜歡的事物。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerId": "char_2014_nian",
      "text": "還有，我們兄弟姐妹間......你也感覺到了。有人和我們站在一邊的，有人不在乎，但也有人，瘋的很徹底。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerId": "char_2015_dusk",
      "text": "......不可能。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerId": "char_2014_nian",
      "text": "是嗎？你其實心底裡有幾個懷疑人選吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerId": "char_2015_dusk",
      "text": "他們都在真龍身邊，又有什麼機會......不......也不對......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerId": "char_2014_nian",
      "text": "你總不能比我還糊塗吧，想想看這漫長的歷史，他們的影子出現了幾次？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerId": "char_2014_nian",
      "text": "時至今日，那些權傾朝野的大官宦，也會派遣信使來往那座小小寺廟的側殿......我可不瞎。大家都不瞎。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerId": "char_2014_nian",
      "text": "枷鎖管得住你嗎？那又憑什麼管得住別人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerId": "char_2015_dusk",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerId": "char_2014_nian",
      "text": "時間確實不多了，不管是誰把我們逼到了這個地步，都不多了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerId": "char_2014_nian",
      "text": "你還記得，你最後一次安然入眠，是什麼時候嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerId": "char_2014_nian",
      "text": "哦哦，好險好險，你也太不愛惜你的作品了吧。這可是你自己的畫哎，你哪裡有臉教訓我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerId": "char_2015_dusk",
      "text": "滿口胡話......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerId": "char_2014_nian",
      "text": "你不承認？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerId": "char_2015_dusk",
      "text": "......倒也未必。你說的話，的確值得我稍作思忖。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerId": "char_2015_dusk",
      "text": "可這些，和你身邊的“羅德島”有什麼關聯？和你要做的事情有什麼關聯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerId": "char_2014_nian",
      "text": "去了你就知道了，那可真是個好地方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerId": "char_2015_dusk",
      "text": "......不少人，已經默默接受了這個既定的命運。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerId": "char_2015_dusk",
      "text": "我們會消失，它會醒來，我們重新成為我，然後死在大炎都城的崩毀聲中，魚死網破。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerId": "char_2015_dusk",
      "text": "這又有什麼意義......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerId": "char_2014_nian",
      "text": "這麼多年，你就想出這麼個答案？婆婆媽媽的，那個清高不可一世的夕去哪了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerId": "char_2015_dusk",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerId": "char_2014_nian",
      "text": "罷了罷了，咱們這樣打下去，再拆掉幾幅畫都是停不下來的，嘿咻——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerId": "char_2015_dusk",
      "text": "慢著，你不會又要——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerId": "char_2014_nian",
      "text": "啊，這可是最新產品。高八尺寬三尺半，採用泰拉大地前所未有的物質引爆——我心愛的二踢腳！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerId": "char_2015_dusk",
      "text": "......嘖。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerId": "char_2014_nian",
      "text": "喲，回來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "年！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "恩人，我怎麼聞著有一股燒焦味呢......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_144",
      "text": "......年在朝我們使眼色，還是躲遠點吧，肯定沒好事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerId": "char_2015_dusk",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerId": "char_2014_nian",
      "text": "該說的都說了，曉之以理，動之以情，你到底怎麼說？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerId": "char_2015_dusk",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerId": "char_2015_dusk",
      "text": "我一開始就說了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerId": "char_2014_nian",
      "text": "畫地為牢對你自己有什麼好處？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerId": "char_2014_nian",
      "text": "跟我去羅德島，還不是可以玩得很開心。我們可以把其他人也聚到一起，對，在羅德島開個家庭派對。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerId": "char_2014_nian",
      "text": "然後就可以好好討論一下咱們的，家庭問題。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerId": "char_2015_dusk",
      "text": "羅德島......到底有什麼值得你堅持的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerId": "char_2015_dusk",
      "text": "還有，你想把他們全部喊到一起？哈，這件事比我們現在立刻跟大炎開戰還要荒唐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerId": "char_2014_nian",
      "text": "......如果你不答應我，我也不能看著你墮入瘋狂，無聲消散。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerId": "char_2015_dusk",
      "text": "那是你的事......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerId": "char_2014_nian",
      "text": "哦，意思是，還是不打不行？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerId": "char_2015_dusk",
      "text": "打也只是你的事。兵戈相見，最是無聊，幾百年前就不興這套做法了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerId": "char_2015_dusk",
      "text": "......但你今天的確惹惱了我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerId": "char_2014_nian",
      "text": "嚯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerId": "char_2014_nian",
      "text": "小炎熔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "呃？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerId": "char_2014_nian",
      "text": "離遠點，下山，去別的地方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerId": "char_2014_nian",
      "text": "接下來，不是你們能插手的——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "speakerId": "char_362_Saga",
      "text": "嗯？這裡是......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "speakerId": "char_362_Saga",
      "text": "——唔哦？小僧這就回來了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "speakerId": "char_362_Saga",
      "text": "嗯？這不是炎熔小姐嗎，克洛絲小姐和烏有也在？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "speakerId": "char_362_Saga",
      "text": "哦哦，是先生——呃，這位是？莫非是先生的姐姐？幸會幸會！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "speakerId": "char_362_Saga",
      "text": "小僧名喚嵯峨，是一位來自東國的雲遊僧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerId": "char_2014_nian",
      "text": "哈......這就有意思了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "speakerId": "char_362_Saga",
      "text": "呃？先生為何一副疑惑眼神？啊，莫非小僧嘴邊還沾著飯菜......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerId": "char_2015_dusk",
      "text": "......你......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerId": "char_2014_nian",
      "text": "飯菜？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "speakerId": "char_362_Saga",
      "text": "小僧方才與諸多自己吃了頓素齋，哎呀，真是久違的味道，心滿意足，心滿意足！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerId": "char_2015_dusk",
      "text": "你是怎麼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "speakerId": "char_362_Saga",
      "text": "啥？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerId": "char_2015_dusk",
      "text": "你如何......離開的畫卷？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "speakerId": "char_362_Saga",
      "text": "其實小僧也不知怎的，就這麼回來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "speakerId": "char_362_Saga",
      "text": "只記得第一個見得的，是如今的小僧，最後一個見得，還是如今的小僧，至於中間萬重山水，皆如過眼雲煙，想來可能是小僧的種種念想吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "speakerId": "char_362_Saga",
      "text": "於是小僧便和畫裡的小僧並肩而行，從他日聊到今日，從大炎原路走回了寺廟。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "speakerId": "char_362_Saga",
      "text": "到最後推門而入，小僧倒是突然想起了住持爺爺對於那副畫，有意無心的一句感慨——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerId": "char_2015_dusk",
      "text": "......感慨？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "speakerId": "char_362_Saga",
      "text": "住持爺爺說，“看山還是山，見水仍是水。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerId": "char_2015_dusk",
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "speakerId": "char_362_Saga",
      "text": "然後等回過神來，發現面前不過一面梳妝鏡罷了，再回過頭，我就在這啦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "speakerId": "char_362_Saga",
      "text": "不過那個變成賭鬼的小僧還真是讓人心有餘悸，看來小僧日後萬萬不能沾賭呀......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerId": "char_2015_dusk",
      "text": "......呵，難怪，看來你師父和我，都給你說道了太多，那個小沙彌......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerId": "char_2015_dusk",
      "text": "平生所見，皆不在目前......好一個看山是山，看水是水，呵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerId": "char_2014_nian",
      "text": "妹妹啊，這麼不服輸，就有點難看了啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerId": "char_2015_dusk",
      "text": "我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerId": "char_2015_dusk",
      "text": "雖然你先後被點醒過兩次......但你的悟性，還是讓人......深感意外。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerId": "char_2014_nian",
      "text": "你記不記得，很久很久很久以前，我們打過一個賭？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerId": "char_2015_dusk",
      "text": "......哼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerId": "char_2014_nian",
      "text": "現在你輸了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerId": "char_2014_nian",
      "text": "哎，別想耍賴，我可知道這麼多年來有不止一個人類衝破了你想像的邊界，之前我就不追究啦，不過這次可是發生在我眼前的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerId": "char_2015_dusk",
      "text": "別得理不饒人，小心惹上麻煩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerId": "char_2014_nian",
      "text": "別忘了我說的話，事情並非沒有轉機。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerId": "char_2015_dusk",
      "text": "......轉機。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerId": "char_2015_dusk",
      "text": "好吧，好吧......願賭服輸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerId": "char_2015_dusk",
      "text": "堅持下去也沒什麼意義......無妨，就讓我在近處，看看你究竟能做到哪一步。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerId": "char_2014_nian",
      "text": "會讓你大吃一驚的，“好妹妹”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerId": "char_2015_dusk",
      "text": "哼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerId": "char_2014_nian",
      "text": "小炎熔，辛苦你們啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "呃，你妹妹好像不太開心的樣子，不用管她？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerId": "char_2014_nian",
      "text": "......沒關係，她畫地為牢多少年了，一下子要接觸這麼多人，恐怕有點不太行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerId": "char_2014_nian",
      "text": "你就當她有點社交障礙，或者當她比較怕生吧，都行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerId": "char_2014_nian",
      "text": "啊，搭話是會被罵的，烏有兄，別自找沒趣了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "好、好的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_144",
      "text": "......所以，這算任務結束了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "你是怎麼來到這裡的......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerId": "char_2014_nian",
      "text": "......秘密手段。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "下一步呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerId": "char_2014_nian",
      "text": "找輛載具回羅德島？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerId": "char_2014_nian",
      "text": "順路還能吃吃喝喝，就當旅遊散心吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerId": "char_2014_nian",
      "text": "勾吳地界的菜品細膩精緻，但於我而言，還是稍顯寡淡，沒啥意思——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerId": "char_2015_dusk",
      "text": "——荒唐，秋末鱸鱗，肥美之極，輔以青山綠水，人間絕妙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerId": "char_2014_nian",
      "text": "......鱸鱗雖好，還是比不過火鍋配酒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerId": "char_2015_dusk",
      "text": "呵呵，真該讓小個子給你露上兩手，大炎料理之廣博，為你開開眼界。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerId": "char_2015_dusk",
      "text": "就算是火鍋也有諸多講究，你這種人只知道逞口舌之快的，肯定一無所知。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerId": "char_2014_nian",
      "text": "哦？你一個吃墨水的，有資格教訓我什麼叫“眼界”？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerId": "char_2015_dusk",
      "text": "哪敢哪敢，看你這身衣服，就像剛落果栽進土裡的辣椒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerId": "char_2015_dusk",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerId": "char_2014_nian",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "別、別又打起來啊！好不容易才停下來，克洛絲，你也勸勸她們！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_144",
      "text": "路線我已經調查好了，至少能吃到十七家著名的地方菜系餐館。這樣就不會有問題了吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerId": "char_2014_nian",
      "text": "嗯，這倒是還行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerId": "char_2015_dusk",
      "text": "......哼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "恩人！恩人！欸，咱們借一步說話！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "啥呀，這麼神神秘秘的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "你看，反正我本來也是打算去龍門找份營生，如此這般，看幾位好像都是那“羅德島”的雇員，不知道你們那裡，還招不招人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "你看我啥都能幹！身體又好，還不害怕感染者！價格公道，童叟無欺！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "呃......你可以跟我們一起回去接受測驗，但這也不是我說了算的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "如此甚好！請務必讓我和幾位同行吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "......突然變得好熱鬧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "speakerId": "char_362_Saga",
      "text": "先生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerId": "char_2015_dusk",
      "text": "......嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "speakerId": "char_362_Saga",
      "text": "小僧會銘記在畫卷中的時日。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerId": "char_2015_dusk",
      "text": "不記得也罷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "speakerId": "char_362_Saga",
      "text": "小僧可不如先生，人生苦短，想忘也是忘不掉的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerId": "char_2015_dusk",
      "text": "......那真可憐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerId": "char_2015_dusk",
      "text": "你那師父現在......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "speakerId": "char_362_Saga",
      "text": "住持爺爺仍然健在，不過已經百又二十歲高齡啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerId": "char_2015_dusk",
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerId": "char_2015_dusk",
      "text": "你也和他們走嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "speakerId": "char_362_Saga",
      "text": "不，小僧......小僧想繼續雲遊四方，離開炎國，去更遠的大地。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "speakerId": "char_362_Saga",
      "text": "小僧，心向神往。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "speakerId": "char_362_Saga",
      "text": "不過，炎熔施主倒的確是頂好的人，想必那羅德島也是一處妙趣橫生地，若是他日有緣，小僧也許會去拜訪一番。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "speakerId": "char_362_Saga",
      "text": "不過，也不知道那是何時的事情了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerId": "char_2015_dusk",
      "text": "......呵，挺好，這是你們的特權了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "speakerId": "char_362_Saga",
      "text": "先生足不出戶，就坐享江山萬里，羡慕不來呀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerId": "char_2015_dusk",
      "text": "要真如我一般江山看膩，再走萬萬里，也無趣啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerId": "char_2015_dusk",
      "text": "拙山盡起。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerId": "char_2015_dusk",
      "text": "要是有朝一日還能有機會，就告訴他，這加筆，不算太差。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "......烏有，後面是不是有輛車，跟了好久了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "他們好像是衝著你來的，要幫忙嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "不勞煩恩人啦......我自己解決。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_144",
      "text": "答應你師父的事情呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "誰說不用扇子，就對付不了這些小人了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "光天化日之下，就膽敢在城外行兇，這還有沒有王法了！我今天就是要給他們一個教訓——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "啊，又來兩輛車。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_144",
      "text": "還有人拿著武器呢，陣仗真大啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "......恩、恩人呐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "唉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "既然來者不善......那我們上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
